# T4: TIMED arm A of the A B C A B C A B sequence of the window (T1..T8; A = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix, the production profile; B = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-w2, W2 alone; C = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2, COMBINED). Audits off in every arm; each job follows its own all-four reset in this one image.
# No Lever N on A or B: B against A is W2's round-time delta and nothing else; C against B is Lever N's steady-state cost on top of W2 (its scheduler wrapper and epoch scope; it must sit inside the floor), C against A the combined arm. Tests: warmup, coding,
# concurrent8_steady and concurrent8_code_equal (about 4k), eight 32k users, eight users of about 120k and the skewed eight. READ with scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py judge (eight-live rounds, paired by mean-context bucket INSIDE each length's window: steady, 32k, 128k, skew; 100 matched rounds a window else VOID; the load median and the pair's load gap applied),
# texts by the smoke JSON hashes, the burst wall time and the last TTFT report-only. Check the load average around every job: no build, no CI push, no other job beside it.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the combined development window (docs/tp4-combined-window.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/w2-levern-prefix and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the NEEDS graph, the swap
# rules and every read and cutover rule. ONE IMAGE FOR THE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2ln-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed branch commit; every window job serves it. The jobs named
# CTL (and T0, G0, E1-CTL) run the PRODUCTION base image tp4-serve-10 (the production engine bytes), driven from this same window commit: the host-side scripts (the smoke shapes, the gates, the kill-switch preflight, the load logger, the raised exactness-shared box) are the window's.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2ln-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_128k,concurrent8_skew
